Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.77,0:00:16.99,Main Dialogue,O1,0000,0000,0000,,They've broken through Area 9.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:20.49,Main Dialogue,O2,0000,0000,0000,,They're heading to Sector 10 \Nthrough Corridor 117.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.93,0:00:23.24,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,I knew Vitaly would be headed there...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.59,0:00:27.30,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Sector 11...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.16,0:00:30.13,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liza...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.41,0:02:04.30,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Close all of the bulkheads!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.78,0:02:08.16,Episode Title,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1500,1500)}{\c&H0303C1&}Fri{\c&HFFFFFF&}ends
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.30,0:02:05.43,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Roger that!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:08.81,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-sama?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.31,0:02:11.88,Italics Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Hey, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.88,0:02:14.99,Italics Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I thought you'd be wanting \Nto hear from me about now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.07,0:02:19.22,Main Dialogue Top,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Leave Vitaly to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:22.83,Main Dialogue Top,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,It's not like we don't know each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.23,0:02:25.37,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,But, Onii-sama, Liza is...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.41,0:02:28.96,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Claire, trust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.24,0:02:30.50,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Onii-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.56,0:02:33.88,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liza...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.69,0:02:41.47,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,It sucks that they don't have a core.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.96,0:02:44.01,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, there's no real weak point.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.79,0:02:55.87,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.19,0:03:00.65,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,You care for your friend, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.65,0:03:02.03,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Submit to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.44,0:03:04.03,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,You're nothing but tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.66,0:03:07.79,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.59,0:03:14.17,Main Dialogue,Mei-Mai,0000,0000,0000,,They're not your tools or your slaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.49,0:03:16.41,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Know your place, automaton!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.88,0:03:27.14,Main Dialogue,Mei-Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.12,0:03:33.98,Main Dialogue,Mei-Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you all okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.80,0:03:42.66,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Is your leg okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.94,0:03:44.72,Main Dialogue,Mei-Mai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.15,0:03:47.28,Main Dialogue,Mei-Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.28,0:03:49.04,Main Dialogue,Mei-Mai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll get help here right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.48,0:03:51.39,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.44,0:03:54.54,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Thank... you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.20,0:04:06.13,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Liza Harvey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.52,0:04:11.02,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Who would have thought \Nwe'd see each other again here,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.01,0:04:13.89,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Vitaly Tynyanov?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.06,0:04:16.23,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Judar...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.50,0:04:19.82,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,So you knew I'd come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.41,0:04:21.86,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,From the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.81,0:04:26.90,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,You knew I might be here too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.72,0:04:30.93,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. You saved me \Nthe trouble of finding you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.58,0:04:32.96,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to pull?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.96,0:04:34.46,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,You know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.46,0:04:36.71,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,This is revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.71,0:04:40.23,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,You pretended to love me, \Nthen used and discarded me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:41.79,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,You misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.79,0:04:43.03,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.03,0:04:45.71,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to destroy Liza \Nin front of your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.71,0:04:47.64,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,and sink the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:53.65,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,First I'm going to show those Slayers \Njust how powerless they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.10,0:05:04.15,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.31,0:05:10.28,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What in the world is this noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.62,0:05:14.25,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Detecting sound waves being emitted \Nfrom the replicants and the bee-types.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.25,0:05:16.79,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,The whole ship is being affected.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.05,0:05:22.30,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It seems these sound waves\Nare targeted to hurt Slayers alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:30.07,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I'm emitting sound waves which act on the virus \Nthat Slayers are infected with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.54,0:05:36.10,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It's only a matter of time \Nbefore the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0} falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.49,0:05:38.29,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Impressive, Vitaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.23,0:05:41.61,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Your work is always beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.87,0:05:47.52,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,If I said I wanted you again, \Nwould you help me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.52,0:05:49.07,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Don't mess with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.07,0:05:53.49,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,I came here in order to\Npush you into despair.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:05:58.55,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Stop now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.55,0:05:59.75,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,You can still be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.75,0:06:01.50,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,This is the end, Judar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.82,0:06:15.16,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.62,0:06:19.48,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Why is she awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:23.65,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Do you remember Kirishima Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.10,0:06:26.74,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Kirishima... Sakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:30.02,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Liza reacted to her songs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.96,0:06:35.49,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,I made a little wager,\N hoping she'd awaken faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.95,0:06:38.50,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,I used you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.65,0:06:43.84,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,You calculated all of this, and even \Nput the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0} in danger...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.74,0:06:47.09,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Would I have any other reason \Nto see you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.41,0:06:51.47,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Again, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.47,0:06:53.48,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Judar!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.44,0:07:06.23,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You damn monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.69,0:07:16.23,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,How rude of you to address\Nmy sister in that manner.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.36,0:07:33.19,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,I thank you, Vitaly.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.14,0:07:37.47,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,You have helped my plans\Nprogress quite a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:44.98,Main Dialogue,Vitaly,0000,0000,0000,,I hate myself for being the slightest \Nbit happy after hearing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.10,0:07:54.47,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for waking you, Liza.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.70,0:07:58.26,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,You can rest within the capsule.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.02,0:08:01.90,Main Dialogue,Judar,0000,0000,0000,,We will talk again when the time comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.43,0:08:04.17,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,No, Onii-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.65,0:08:10.76,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,I have something that I must do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.47,0:08:13.38,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:16.60,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.60,0:08:25.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.50,0:08:26.87,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not going to let you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.25,0:08:52.39,Italics Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,If only I had the power...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:55.14,Italics Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,The power to save everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.93,0:08:57.51,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,You do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:08:59.53,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.81,0:09:07.74,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,You have your song.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.24,0:09:09.23,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Song?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.69,0:09:10.81,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.81,0:09:13.61,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,The power to drive this terrible noise away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.64,0:09:16.74,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,To drive it away...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:20.37,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Sing for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.89,0:09:22.77,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,For the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:28.42,Italics Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,I have my songs!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.44,0:09:38.98,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Now you'll be able to stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.33,0:09:44.81,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,Karen-chan, let's sing for everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.60,0:09:48.65,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:52.64,Main Dialogue,Both,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.02,0:10:20.34,Main Dialogue,Liddy,0000,0000,0000,,I can move?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.67,0:10:21.64,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,These voices...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.97,0:10:24.27,Main Dialogue,Erica,0000,0000,0000,,I can feel my strength returning.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.98,0:10:26.64,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, is this...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.91,0:10:29.40,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kirishima Sakura and Kisaragi Karen?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.72,0:10:34.27,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,The singing from the concert hall \Nis canceling out the noise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.79,0:10:38.03,Main Dialogue,O1,0000,0000,0000,,All Slayers are returning to action.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.00,0:10:41.03,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,This is the power...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.80,0:10:43.47,Italics Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,...of their song.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.26,0:10:49.23,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,This is Sakura and Karen's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.38,0:10:52.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I can fight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.41,0:10:55.71,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I only have one chance!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.08,0:11:14.48,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,This ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.63,0:11:38.30,Main Dialogue,O1,0000,0000,0000,,Trenta-class replicant down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.30,0:11:40.30,Main Dialogue,O2,0000,0000,0000,,We have no casualties.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.48,0:11:44.30,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What happened to Kisaragi Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.73,0:11:47.81,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato is at zero percent \Nenergy remaining,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.49,0:11:51.31,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,but there's no danger to his life.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.33,0:11:58.36,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You did well,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:00.69,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.09,0:12:05.32,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,The Trenta-class replicant is reactivating.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.90,0:12:07.46,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,It's still active.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.46,0:12:08.33,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.27,0:12:18.34,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Detecting a large amount \Nof energy from its head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.34,0:12:19.78,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,It's going to fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.05,0:12:24.34,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.20,0:12:43.45,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Nakri!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.54,0:12:52.30,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Nee-chan, take care of Nakri.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:57.99,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,Vitaly!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.50,0:13:04.03,Main Dialogue,Krovanh,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not letting you get away with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.27,0:13:11.02,Main Dialogue,Nakri,0000,0000,0000,,Krovanh!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:16.10,Main Dialogue,Mei-Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Krovanh-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.30,0:13:19.19,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Chris, I'm going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.19,0:13:20.53,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Take care of things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.53,0:13:21.11,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.85,0:13:28.68,Italics Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,I have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.68,0:13:30.97,Italics Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,I have to save him. I have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.97,0:13:32.17,Italics Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,I have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.17,0:13:33.82,Italics Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,I have to save him. I have to save him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.82,0:13:35.71,Italics Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,I have to save him! I have to save him!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.82,0:13:43.23,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Trace On!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.13,0:14:28.88,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,She traced the replicant...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.88,0:14:30.75,Main Dialogue,Mei-Mai,0000,0000,0000,,Nesat-chan...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.75,0:14:31.89,Main Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.57,0:14:34.52,Italics Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,Claire, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.52,0:14:36.14,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What is it, Char?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.61,0:14:40.64,Italics Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,She's in the same situation \Nas when Liza went out of control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.52,0:14:42.67,Italics Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,At this rate...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.67,0:14:43.27,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.11,0:14:49.78,Italics Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,She'll lose control of her energy \Nand cause a huge explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.21,0:14:52.37,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Is there any way to stop her \Nfrom going out of control?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.86,0:14:55.06,Italics Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,There is one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.06,0:14:55.79,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.43,0:14:58.40,Italics Dialogue,Char,0000,0000,0000,,If we cease her vital function,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.40,0:15:01.33,Italics Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,now that she's been absorbed by the replicant,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.33,0:15:03.29,Italics Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,I imagine it'll stop it from happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.23,0:15:08.33,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.22,0:15:10.63,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.69,0:15:23.06,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.35,0:15:26.32,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like we get to see each other again.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.37,0:15:28.35,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.75,0:15:31.24,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Is everyone on the {\i1}Little Garden{\i0} okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.81,0:15:33.82,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Things are getting worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.60,0:15:36.69,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,However, Kisaragi Hayato,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.22,0:15:39.50,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,you might be able to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.39,0:15:43.17,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I can... save her?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:52.97,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Please, save the {\i1}Little Garden,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.97,0:15:54.85,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,save that girl,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:56.81,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,and save my sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.68,0:16:05.23,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Energy is increasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.23,0:16:06.90,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,4,000... 6,000...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.90,0:16:08.03,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.01,0:16:11.19,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,She isn't guilty of anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.49,0:16:17.57,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,but I have a responsibility \Nas the captain of the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.06,0:16:19.23,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I will...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.23,0:16:20.34,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Please wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.34,0:16:21.72,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.72,0:16:24.71,Italics Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Please give me time to save Nesat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.37,0:16:27.26,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,What are you going on about?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.67,0:16:30.56,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,The lives of thousands of people are at stake!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.56,0:16:31.92,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.31,0:16:35.68,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,But Nesat's life is just as important\Nas every one of those.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.99,0:16:39.93,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.61,0:16:43.94,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,However, I will end this when I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.05,0:16:46.30,Italics Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Understood?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.99,0:16:49.08,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, President.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.85,0:16:53.74,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Hundred On!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:01.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Nesat, can you hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.75,0:17:02.71,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.71,0:17:04.39,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.76,0:17:08.04,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi... Hayato...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.93,0:17:10.47,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Little Garden...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.86,0:17:12.06,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Slayer...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.95,0:17:15.51,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Slayers are the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:26.10,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I won't say I understand the pain \Nand suffering you went through,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.10,0:17:31.32,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,but one twist of fate, \Nand I might have become like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.69,0:17:33.35,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Slayer!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.35,0:17:35.24,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.35,0:17:52.51,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.51,0:17:54.77,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I know you can do it, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.15,0:17:56.15,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.92,0:17:57.93,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.67,0:18:04.43,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama, we have \Nless than three minutes now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.43,0:18:06.39,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Did you hear that, Kisaragi Hayato?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.39,0:18:08.73,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have any time. Hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.72,0:18:11.40,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Nesat, listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.70,0:18:14.36,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You're free now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.36,0:18:16.08,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You can live freely now!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.08,0:18:18.28,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Free...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.70,0:18:22.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,The likes of Vitaly won't control you anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.97,0:18:25.86,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I want to protect the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.32,0:18:29.31,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,And I want to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.31,0:18:30.75,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Believe in me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.70,0:18:33.19,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Believe...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.68,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,...in you...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.68,0:18:37.22,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,It doesn't have to be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.84,0:18:40.05,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,If there's someone out there \Nyou can believe in,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.05,0:18:41.36,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,then it can be them!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.24,0:18:45.47,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Please know we won't betray you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.31,0:18:48.52,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Be...lieve...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.43,0:18:57.44,Main Dialogue,Chris,0000,0000,0000,,Claire-sama, we can't hold out any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.92,0:19:00.20,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.64,0:19:21.55,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Nesat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.19,0:19:24.12,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Nesat, can you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.12,0:19:25.28,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Nesat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.50,0:19:28.03,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Believe in us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.03,0:19:29.94,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,In the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.77,0:19:35.33,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Believe... in you...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.57,0:19:40.45,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Can I really trust you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.11,0:19:42.37,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,You can.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.26,0:19:44.95,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,We're friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.59,0:19:49.95,Main Dialogue,Nesat,0000,0000,0000,,Friends...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.26,0:20:03.59,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome to the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.63,0:20:20.77,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.87,0:20:23.55,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,You did it, Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.36,0:20:25.47,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.55,0:20:44.81,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Nee-sama.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:48.84,Main Dialogue,Liza,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you for protecting the {\i1}Little Garden.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:50.99,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,Liza!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.01,0:21:07.35,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Hayato.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.85,0:21:11.08,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,A lot of things have happened \Nsince we first came to the school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.51,0:21:12.67,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.16,0:21:16.32,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,A lot more is going to happen, I'm sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.81,0:21:19.95,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,But I only want one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:20.59,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:36.40,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,My wish is to always be with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.87,0:21:39.15,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile—
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:41.65,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Emilia right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.04,0:21:49.37,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emilia... I want to be with you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.47,0:22:02.52,Main Dialogue,Reitia,0000,0000,0000,,Who knew there was a place \Nlike this in the school?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.52,0:22:05.13,Main Dialogue,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,I get to train with Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.13,0:22:07.93,Main Dialogue,Noah,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure the fireworks will be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.94,0:22:13.91,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,E-Everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.91,0:22:16.14,Main Dialogue,Fritz,0000,0000,0000,,I guess we're sorry for intruding!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.14,0:22:17.63,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,N-Nii-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.63,0:22:19.71,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?! You're both guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.71,0:22:21.32,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,I... uh... that is...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:26.15,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,That's enough, Kisaragi Hayato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.84,0:22:29.40,Main Dialogue,Claudia,0000,0000,0000,,How dare you do that to the princess of
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.40,0:22:32.91,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,the glorious Kingdom of Gudenburg, \NEmilia-sama!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.23,0:22:35.20,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey! Don't say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.20,0:22:37.30,Main Dialogue,Leah,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? Princess Emilia?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.16,0:22:40.28,Main Dialogue,Xuemei,0000,0000,0000,,Princess of Gudenburg?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.47,0:22:45.80,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I can't hide it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.40,0:22:47.50,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,Emile...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.51,0:22:52.05,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for hiding it up until now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.05,0:22:55.32,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,My real name is Emilia Gudenburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.84,0:22:59.56,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,I'm actually a girl and a princess.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.13,0:23:02.69,Main Dialogue,All,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.98,0:23:04.44,Main Dialogue,Karen,0000,0000,0000,,A... a girl?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.44,0:23:07.00,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,A-And a princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.25,0:23:10.41,Main Dialogue,Miharu,0000,0000,0000,,A commoner and royalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.41,0:23:12.70,Main Dialogue,Souffle,0000,0000,0000,,Romantic, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.70,0:23:14.18,Main Dialogue,Sakura,0000,0000,0000,,No, it isn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.58,0:23:19.17,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I told her not to do stuff like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.09,0:23:25.42,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,P-President?!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.62,0:23:31.04,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,I was wondering where you went,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.04,0:23:34.23,Main Dialogue,,0000,0000,0000,,and you were messing around here...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.23,0:23:35.00,Main Dialogue,Hayato,0000,0000,0000,,President!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.00,0:23:36.88,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.88,0:23:40.35,Main Dialogue,Claire,0000,0000,0000,,As the captain of the {\i1}Little Garden,{\i0} \NI can't let this be!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.24,0:23:48.24,Main Dialogue,Emile,0000,0000,0000,,President, you dummy!
